(7690672, 1260188, 34171, '<td valign="top">@Neat, Thank you.  Not as many as you''d think.  This was my second time doing a Water Tank shoot, so I had some practice before I tried this one.  I also did all kinds of other fruit and veggies, before I got the the Apples, so I only had maybe 20 apple shots.</td>', '@Neat, Thank you.  Not as many as you''d think.  This was my second time doing a Water Tank shoot, so I had some practice before I tried this one.  I also did all kinds of other fruit and veggies, before I got the the Apples, so I only had maybe 20 apple shots.', '2021-03-31 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
