(7690684, 1260188, 34171, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> WOW .. i''ve heard this is a very difficult thing to capture .. i''ve never tried .. leave it to the experts i reckon .. and you seem to be one of them .. <br/>its a stunning image .. perfect in every way .. <br/>it also seems to give off quite a happy feeling .. imbuing those apples with a ton of personality .. its like they are jumping for joy .. !! .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much Roz.  It''s not that hard, just need 3 speedlights and a fish-tank and lots of tries.  There are some good videos on how to do this on Youtube.</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: WOW .. i''ve heard this is a very difficult thing to capture .. i''ve never tried .. leave it to the experts i reckon .. and you seem to be one of them .. its a stunning image .. perfect in every way .. it also seems to give off quite a happy feeling .. imbuing those apples with a ton of personality .. its like they are jumping for joy .. !! .. :)   Thank you so much Roz.  It''s not that hard, just need 3 speedlights and a fish-tank and lots of tries.  There are some good videos on how to do this on Youtube.', '2021-03-31 15:27:40.000000', NULL, 0),
