(7691267, 1260097, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh I love Tricky cider! You must live in the same area as me. I am in Hemyock Devon but assume from your username you are in Dorset - not a million miles away. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh yes I feel very blessed to live in the Blackdown Hills area - it is a beautiful part of the world. West Dorset isn''t too shabby either - Lyme Regis is a regular destination for us.</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Oh I love Tricky cider! You must live in the same area as me. I am in Hemyock Devon but assume from your username you are in Dorset - not a million miles away.   Oh yes I feel very blessed to live in the Blackdown Hills area - it is a beautiful part of the world. West Dorset isn''t too shabby either - Lyme Regis is a regular destination for us.', '2021-04-07 07:17:33.000000', NULL, 0);
